OL,3,GNEWSASnake's alive: Pet python found
OL,4,Aweeks after escape
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pet python has been found alive more
OL,7,Fthan two weeks after she escaped from
OL,8,Fher owner's home.
OL,10,FJacob Edwards said his ball python
OL,11,FXanthe went missing from his home in
OL,12,FBretton, Peterborough, on 11 September,
OL,13,Fbut was finally found in his
OL,14,Fneighbour's garden on Tuesday.
OL,16,FThe 4.5ft (1.4m) snake had escaped
OL,17,Fthrough a small vent in the back of her
OL,18,Fenclosure before leaving Edwards' home
OL,19,Fthrough a door which had accidentally
OL,20,Fbeen left open.
