OL,3,GNEWSASnake's alive: Pet python found
OL,4,Aweeks after escape
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It completely threw me off and I
OL,7,Fabsolutely had no hope that she would
OL,8,Fstill be alive nearly three weeks
OL,9,Flater," the 23-year-old said.
